title: $:/plugins/nikorion/base-fields/language/en-GB/

Readme/Column/Field: Field
Readme/Column/Control: Control
Readme/Control/vocab: a dropdown of the vocabulary's values
Readme/Control/vocab-radio: radio buttons, one per value of the vocabulary
Readme/Control/vocab-list: one checkbox per value of the vocabulary
Readme/Control/value: one value, typed or picked among those already used
Readme/Control/list: pills plus an input, edited like the tags
